  "targets_source": "Scores are against an 80/20 beef control cooked to 71 \u00b0C core, which our panel rates firmness 6 and juiciness 7 on the anchored 0\u201310 scale (12 panellists, two sessions, February 2026). Above firmness 7 the patty eats rubbery; below juiciness 5 it eats dry and chalky. Contains soy and wheat (gluten).",
